{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an apocalyptic world full of zombies, you and your girlfriend have to face several dangerous adversities. You already have the girl with you, but can you keep her by your side, or will you let her be corrupted by the darkness of the other perverts around her? The game is a mix between a visual novel and a roguelike. It contains explicit 18+ content, NTR. <br>The game has <strong><i>four </i></strong>different endings, depending on the player's decisions throughout the adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Language:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>English/Spanish</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want me to add another language, I'd be happy to do so.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W, A, S, D = Move <br>Q = Eat <br>E = Heal <br>Left Mouse Click = Melee Attack <br>Right Mouse Click = Shot <br>ESC = Pause/Options <br>SPACE = Dash <br>ENTER = Next Dialog</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WARNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every activity you perform consumes HEALTH and ENERGY. If either of those two bars reaches 0, the player dies, so always keep an eye on these bars.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3878590?t=1757078917","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3878590?t=1757078917","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878590/59fff3f00db0e9ceb88de45df143f0af1d99d351/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757078917","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878590/59fff3f00db0e9ceb88de45df143f0af1d99d351/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757078917","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Save Anytime","